e reference forecast. Neither is ranked.", "rainfallAI-S2S and its statistical baseline post-process GEFS / CFS with observations; GEFS, CFS and the S2S-database centres are ensemble means (smooth, which helps MSE-type scores); group_rank compares like with like.", "Only systems built for subseasonal (2-4 week) forecasts are listed; medium-range weather and AI models run out to 28 days are left out of this table.", "rainfallAI-S2S: version chosen after scores on this same period were seen (several test looks), so these numbers are optimistic; the clean comparison is the forward table from the 2026-11-09 cycle (rainfallAI frozen 2026-11-08)."], "policy": "Rows whose start is not available in real time (ERA5, which assimilates observations from after the start, or IFS starts with same-day OISST sea temperature / ERA5 clouds) are shown as an unranked reference; ranked rows share one sample; group_rank = rank within single runs / ensemble means / post-processed products", "group_labels": {"single": "single runs (raw)", "ensmean": "ensemble means (raw)", "postproc": "post-processed on observations", "reference": "reference: start not available in real time (ERA5, or same-day OISST / ERA5 clouds; unranked)"}, "rank_metric": "msess (per week)"}}